{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1854","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Expected Destruction"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have a set $$$S$$$ of $$$n$$$ distinct integers between $$$1$$$ and $$$m$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each second you do the following steps: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Pick an element $$$x$$$ in $$$S$$$ uniformly at random. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Remove $$$x$$$ from $$$S$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If $$$x+1 \\leq m$$$ and $$$x+1$$$ is not in $$$S$$$, add $$$x+1$$$ to $$$S$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"What is the expected number of seconds until $$$S$$$ is empty?"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output the answer modulo $$$1\\,000\\,000\\,007$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Formally, let $$$P = 1\\,000\\,000\\,007$$$. It can be shown that the answer can be expressed as an irreducible fraction $$$\\frac{a}{b}$$$, where $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$ are integers and $$$b \\not \\equiv 0 \\pmod{P}$$$. Output the integer equal to $$$a \\cdot b^{-1} \\bmod P$$$. In other words, output an integer $$$z$$$ such that $$$0 \\le z \\lt P$$$ and $$$z \\cdot b \\equiv a \\pmod{P}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$m$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n \\leq m \\leq 500$$$) — the number of elements in the set $$$S$$$ and the upper bound on the value of the elements in $$$S$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$S_1,\\,S_2,\\,\\dots,\\,S_n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq S_1 \\lt S_2 \\lt \\ldots \\lt S_n \\leq m$$$) — the elements of the set $$$S$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single integer — the expected number of seconds until $$$S$$$ is empty, modulo $$$1\\,000\\,000\\,007$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2 3\n1 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n750000009\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 10\n1 2 3 4 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n300277731\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 10\n2 3 6 8 9\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n695648216\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1 100\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n100\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For test 1, here is a list of all the possible scenarios and their probabilities:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[1, 3]$$$ (50% chance) $$$\\to$$$ $$$[1]$$$ $$$\\to$$$ $$$[2]$$$ $$$\\to$$$ $$$[3]$$$ $$$\\to$$$ $$$[]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[1, 3]$$$ (50% chance) $$$\\to$$$ $$$[2, 3]$$$ (50% chance) $$$\\to$$$ $$$[2]$$$ $$$\\to$$$ $$$[3]$$$ $$$\\to$$$ $$$[]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[1, 3]$$$ (50% chance) $$$\\to$$$ $$$[2, 3]$$$ (50% chance) $$$\\to$$$ $$$[3]$$$ $$$\\to$$$ $$$[]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Adding them up, we get $$$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 4 + \\frac{1}{4} \\cdot 4 + \\frac{1}{4} \\cdot 3 = \\frac{15}{4}$$$. We see that $$$750000009 \\cdot 4 \\equiv 15 \\pmod{1\\,000\\,000\\,007}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1854C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1854/problem/C"}